{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902780/extras/intro.gif?t=1739735950\" />In Ghost Villa is an fps with tower defense elements, you farm and build up your defenses during the day, by night you fight hordes of ghosts that want to haunt and take possession of your home.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Farming</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902780/extras/plants.gif?t=1739735950\" />Take care of a wide variety of crops, and sell the produce to buy better equipment and defense mechanisms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Phantasmagoric Crops</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902780/extras/crops.gif?t=1739735950\" />Due to the excess of spectral energy in the farm your plants will yield special vegetables at night, eat them to gain all kinds of power ups.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Building</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902780/extras/build.gif?t=1739735950\" />Build solar panels, turrets, water tanks, drones, and everything you need to keep your farm productive and safe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Fighting</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902780/extras/FightN.gif?t=1739735950\" />Your specialized gun will allow you to absorb energy from ghosts and use their own energy against them, blast them, dash through walls, take cover among your turrets. Do what you must to protect your home!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2902780?t=1739735950","background